{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Would you say that 2007 cannot be returned? But after 11 long years, 2007 is coming back to us. AGAIN!</strong></h2> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Welcome Back To 2007 Part II, is an old-school platformer game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/848550/extras/f75b902112c6e86af67e7359744f9dd7.avif?t=1775838923\" width=616 height=164 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><strong>\u2714\ufe0f Jetpack working on a real physical model;<br>\u2714\ufe0f Different skins of the main Hero;<br>\u2714\ufe0f Lots of new Enemies, Locations and SPAAAACE;<br>\u2714\ufe0f Cool Story Mode;<br>\u2714\ufe0f Original soundtrack by Anacom and Golod;<br>\u2714\ufe0f Very cool Bosses;<br>\u2714\ufe0f The full Remake is now available absolutely free! New features are already available in the game \ud83d\ude08</strong><br><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You play as Emo Boy, who bridge over the difficulties to achieve his sacred wishes. Evil grandmas, chavs, security guards, goths, weeaboos and haters appear on his way. But our EmoBoy will never surrender! With help of tears, literally, he smashes his way: plunge your enemies into shock by shooting them with your tears. You need to collect cigarettes in order to replenish your Jetpack stock! <br>Your main companion and mentor is Girl with blue hair. She will not let you get bored and always will help you with advice on any trouble!</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"f7d51c4adb3c7bec8abfe7b1fa725e865edb19ed.jpg","localized_name":"Welcome Back To 2007 Part II \u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udd25","name":"Welcome Back To 2007 Part II \u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udd25","path":"https:/